<metadata preset-name="Tweed Blues Drive" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A low-gain mid-hump overdrive nudging a 4x10 tweed bass amp past breakup, with a splash of spring. Fat, touch-sensitive blues: light playing cleans up, hard picking snarls. Neck pickup for slow blues, bridge for shuffles." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
