<headroom-library version="1" id="blues-tweed-drive" category="Crunch" order="20" instrument="guitar" style="Blues">
  <description>A low-gain mid-hump overdrive nudging a 4x10 tweed bass amp past breakup, with a splash of spring. Fat, touch-sensitive blues: light playing cleans up, hard picking snarls. Neck pickup for slow blues, bridge for shuffles.</description>
  <tags><tag>Crunch</tag><tag>Blues</tag><tag>Texas Blues</tag><tag>Overdrive</tag><tag>Spring Reverb</tag></tags>
